    "text_312352519": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Tue Sep 14 2021 21:01:14 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>When our research and development teams began to examine what OB/GYNs need to ensure a safe childbirth, they learned that doctors are looking for a surface that allows them to work quickly to support the mother with the many unique needs they have during labor. Given how quickly the labor can progress, doctors are also looking to simply and easily reposition the patient. The <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/products/ld-304.html\">Birthing Bed</a> encompasses these needs for safe childbirth, allowing HCPs to adjust and remove the Lock-Rite foot section, as well as move mom close to the edge of the bed with speed and ease. To further support comfort for mom, the bed comes with an ultra-comfort mattress with integrated, high-memory egg crate topper.</p>\n<p>Since no two patients and no two births are the same, the bed provides a combination of features: an inflatable lumbar support, a motorized Skoocher, an adjustable seat section, dual labor grips, a labor bar, adjustable foot/calf supports and a variable height foot section that can even be removed for delivery.</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 14 2021 21:05:21 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
